      "question_text": "1 A group of drivers, consisting of 200 women and 300 men, was asked if they passed their driving test at the first attempt. Altogether 167 of the group said they passed at the first attempt. Of the women, 143 said they did not pass at the first attempt. How many of the men said they passed at the first attempt?",
